# Byte-stable checkouts on every platform. data/checksums.sha256 pins the
# bytes of the panel files and tests/test_panels.py verifies them, so text
# files are LF everywhere (Git for Windows defaults to CRLF on checkout) and
# binary files are left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.sqlite binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
